{
  "_doc": "Tier-1 fire lookout on the summit of Cedar Ridge (region D6, hill at 338,2186). A timber tower (prop wild_lookout_tower, origin at the cab centre 12.5,6.5) carries a stair core of three landings (levels 0-2) and a 7x7 glazed cab with a pony-walled catwalk (level 3); a woodshed stands in the yard. Route: the trail comes up from the south -> the stair house door is nailed shut from inside -> round to the broken east window -> up the first flight into the Hollowed piled at the locked stair gate (ambush) -> the card on the gate sends you back down to the woodshed for the spare key (Ezra sleeps by the woodpile) -> through the gate -> second flight -> ladder and trapdoor into the cab (loot; Marnie guards it) -> back down and out through the stair house's bolted back door. Mechanics: the landing's loose boards (creaky floor) or opening the gate wake the gate group; Ezra's bear trap sits on the woodshed doorstep; Marnie (keener) is held in the cab until the player climbs in. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
